AccelerateForExit_Vesting_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the Captable's Exits
│   └── it should revert with OnlyExits
├── when the grant is not accepted
│   └── it should do nothing and not revert
├── when the grant was revoked
│   └── it should do nothing and not revert
├── when the grant has already ended
│   └── it should do nothing and not revert
├── when the grant does not accelerate on exit
│   └── it should do nothing and not revert
└── when the grant accelerates on exit and is live
    ├── it should end the schedule now so nothing is locked
    └── it should emit Accelerated
